WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the seeded sample lessons. Served from the client bundle, so no
request leaves the origin. Replace per-lesson by setting `captionsUrl`.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome back. In this lesson we define one schema per request body.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
We infer the TypeScript type from that schema, so there is a single
source of truth for both validation and types.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Then we return structured 422 errors the frontend can map straight onto
form fields.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
That means a validation rule is written once and enforced everywhere.
